flowchart TD
 Change[Code change] --> PHP[PHP syntax and Pint]
 Change --> Tests[Pest feature/unit tests]
 Change --> Frontend[Vue type-check and Vite build]
 Change --> Docs[Markdown link and diagram inventory]
 PHP --> Review[Review results]
 Tests --> Review
 Frontend --> Review
 Docs --> Review
 Review --> Merge{All required checks pass?}
 Merge -->|Yes| MergeOK[Eligible for maintainer review/merge]
 Merge -->|No| Fix[Correct failure and rerun]
 Fix --> Change
